    rdf:value """Tuesday, Dec. 15, 1908
The Deanery, Bryn Mawr. 
Johnsons in morning. 
Lunched with Mrs. Kirkbride and Dr. and Mrs. Anderson (he a brain specialist at work in  Wistn  Institute).
Came in again with Carey to dine with Mr. Johnson. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 372 ;
